ant 行动与社会实验结果又可回流做数据增强来微调模型（p.4）。文献检索方式：先用 Google Scholar 检索 \"Agentic LLM\"，再用 snowballing 追踪被引但未收录的工作；只收基于 LLM 的方法，排除无 LLM 的多智能体工作（p.5）。答案：categories = reasoning, acting, interacting；search_methods = google_scholar, snowballing。支撑引文（p.4）：\"The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other: the technology that has been developed by the reasoning approaches (category 1) is used for increasingly intelligent acting by assistants. The interactive abilities of the assistants (category 2) enable social simulation experiments.\"；支撑引文（p.5）：\"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\"', evidence_ids=['ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2','ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5'], section='overview')\nprint(n)\nr = recall(['ev-5803bf1c9a0002a5bd4f','ev-f5fa865a87a2cd077881','ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97','ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3'])\nprint(r)\n```", "code_action": "n = write_note(title='overview 主题笔记', content='overview 主题笔记（pp.1-5）：论文把 agentic LLM 的能力分为 reasoning–acting–interacting 三类（p.4），三类逐层构建：reasoning 技术用于 assistant 的 acting，assistant 的 interactive 能力支持社会模拟，assistant 行动与社会实验结果又可回流做数据增强来微调模型（p.4）。文献检索方式：先用 Google Scholar 检索 \"Agentic LLM\"，再用 snowballing 追踪被引但未收录的工作；只收基于 LLM 的方法，排除无 LLM 的多智能体工作（p.5）。答案：categories = reasoning, acting, interacting；search_methods = google_scholar, snowballing。支撑引文（p.4）：\"The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other: the technology that has been developed by the reasoning approaches (category 1) is used for increasingly intelligent acting by assistants. The interactive abilities of the assistants (category 2) enable social simulation experiments.\"；支撑引文（p.5）：\"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\"', evidence_ids=['ev-26c94297c5