{"event": "tool_call", "time": 1793326083.3703406, "run_id": "1452f80891a14f8cb15c6368e02c31ab", "seq": 222, "tool": "write_note", "arguments": {"title": "multi_agent", "content": "multi_agent 主题（pp.35-38）：第4.2节角色互动。CAMEL 用 inception prompting 和角色描述让两个 LLM 保持角色身份并合作分解任务（p.37），引文：“By using inception prompting and role descriptions, the agents stay in character and collaborate toward the goal by breaking down complex problems in manageable steps through dialogue.” 故 camel_prompting = inception_prompting。多智能体还包括 creator-critic（Constitutional AI）、辩论（Du et al.、MAD 三方辩论）、圆桌会议、AutoGen、ChatEval（图23 三种沟通策略）、Sotopia、GovSim。MAgIC 从社会推理游戏抽取七项能力，GPT-o1 与 GPT-4 最优（pp.35-36）。待补：Generative Agents 可信度评估的人类评估者人数。", "evidence_ids": ["ev-98a30db9253fff6cc9da", "ev-a9b70da77a1c104405a2"], "section": "multi_agent"}}
