}, {'id': 'ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:47', 'required': True, 'page': 47, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 5018, 'exposed': True}, {'id': 'ev-aa9b9dbdfec8c640b495', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:48', 'required': True, 'page': 48, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4375, 'exposed': True}, {'id': 'ev-6e64db9ec6bfa8f9417f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:49', 'required': True, 'page': 49, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4295, 'exposed': True}, {'id': 'ev-42cada09d7411017eb46', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:50', 'required': True, 'page': 50, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4663, 'exposed': True}, {'id': 'ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:51', 'required': True, 'page': 51, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 3844, 'exposed': True}, {'id': 'ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'version': 'b4767423c79db69ae7138f4c0aed7733af6385e0a370da21ad7d6fe029d7fb8c', 'locator': 'page:52', 'required': True, 'page': 52, 'valid': True, 'atomic': True, 'chars': 4072, 'exposed': True}], 'notes': {'overview': {'id': 'overview', 'content': 'overview 主题笔记（pp.1-5）：论文把 agentic LLM 的能力分为 reasoning–acting–interacting 三类（p.4），三类逐层构建：reasoning 技术用于 assistant 的 acting，assistant 的 interactive 能力支持社会模拟，assistant 行动与社会实验结果又可回流做数据增强来微调模型（p.4）。文献检索方式：先用 Google Scholar 检索 \"Agentic LLM\"，再用 snowballing 追踪被引但未收录的工作；只收基于 LLM 的方法，排除无 LLM 的多智能体工作（p.5）。答案：categories = reasoning, acting, interacting；search_methods = google_scholar, snowballing。支撑引文（p.4）：\"The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other: the technology that has been developed by the reasoning approaches (category 1) is used for increasingly intelligent acting by assistants. The interactive abilities of the assistants (category 2) enable social simulation experiments.\"；支撑引文（p.5）：\"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\"', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-26c94297c50e4ef408a2', 'ev-dbca06e364385e22f3c5'], 'valid': True, 'request': 4}, 'reasoning': {'id': 'reasoning', 'content': 'reasoning 主题进展（pp.14-16）：prompt 改进可视为强化学习循环——Progressive Hint Prompting (PHP) 反复把问题与答案一起回问 LLM，直到答案稳定（p.14）；Self Refine 用生成/反馈/精修三个 prompt 迭代改进（pp.14-15）；Reflexion 用 actor/evaluator/reflector 三个 LLM 提示，从失败中反思（p.15）。外部自反思与推理时 prompt 改进需要外部记忆：Tree of Thoughts 必须记住已遍历的树分支，Self Refine 记住 prompt 与评估（p.15）。隐式推理（Self-taught reasoner、DeepSeek-R1、RLVR）把推理内化进训练（pp.16-17）。待补：Self Consistency 从多条推理路径确定最终答案的具体规则，以及 Tree of Thoughts 的两种搜索控制器（约 pp.10-13）。', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-2c5302116a7f6c84effa', 'ev-b8db09947ef7c899cd9d', 'ev-ced75d6936911b2f0248', 'ev-9317b06df60c30a6c12c'], 'valid': True, 'request': 8}, 'tool_use': {'id': 'tool_use', 'content': 'tool_use 主题（pp.22-23）：Toolformer 让模型自学何时调用 API、传什么参数并把结果并入后续预测；测试五种工具：calculator、question_answering、search_engine、translation、calendar（p.23）。ToolBench 从 RapidAPI 收集 16,464 个 API（p.23）。局限：选对工具并汇总结果很难，可用 planner/caller/summarizer 分工（p.23）。答案：toolformer_tools = [\\'calculator\\',\\'question_answering\\',\\'search_engine\\',\\'translation\\',\\'calendar\\']；toolbench_api_count = 16464。支撑引文（p.23）：\"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\" 以及 \"ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\"', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62'], 'valid': True, 'request': 10}, 'multi_agent': {'id': 'multi_agent', 'content': 'multi_agent 主题（pp.35-38,46-47）：CAMEL 用 inception prompting 和角色描述让两个 LLM 保持角色身份并合作分解任务（p.46），引文：“By using inception prompting and role descriptions, the agents stay in character and collaborate toward the goal by breaking down complex problems in manageable steps through dialogue.” 故 camel_prompting = inception_prompting。CAMEL 为稳定沟通引入第三个 critic agent，HumanEval 从 30% 提升到约 50%（p.46）。Generative Agents（pp.46-47）架构含 memory、planning、reflection 模块，用 100 名人类评估者按四类标准排序可信度（p.47）：“evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators”。故 generative_agents_evaluators = 100。其他：creator-critic、辩论、圆桌会议、AutoGen、ChatEval、Sotopia、GovSim；MAgIC 从社会推理游戏抽七项能力（pp.35-36）；Park et al. 2024 用 1052 人访谈数据构建 1052 个 agent profile（p.47）。', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'evidence_ids': ['ev-75546d247dedb90561b5', 'ev-f03e4b7f1b7fc6e66886'], 'valid': True, 'request': 18}}}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8343, "output_tokens": 289, "total_tokens": 8632}, "is_final_answer": false}}
